# Apply: patch -p1 < patches/0002-accel-vblank-and-head4.patch
#
# The Intel panel reached over XeGfx is the only display this GPU has, and it is registered
# as display head 4 (NMIntelFB / XeGfxIntelFramebuffer).  The accelerator now waits for the
# framebuffer first-publish notification, maps BAR0 display MMIO, and copies each frame right
# after the panel's vblank instead of on the submit path.  debug.xegfxaccel_iop_* counters
# expose the wait, copy, transaction and gap times; debug.xegfxaccel_iop_vblank and
# debug.xegfxaccel_iop_memcpy switch the two paths.  The nvaccel_* identifiers stay as they
# are in the source; a macro list redirects them to xegfxaccel_* so every sysctl and log line
# carries the XeGfx name instead of the NVIDIA accelerator name.
#

